  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DIBE. Explorer 2019 Tutee</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to establish a close collaboration with the Indian EdTech company Univariety. We aim to create a strategic partnership with Univariety adding our most successful online services to their offer to the Indian market and exploring other apparent synergies between our companies. In the project, we are in
collaboration with Univariety going to design and test our complementary services and business model and
integrate the Tutee services into the Univariety platform furthermore we expect to sign a comprehensive A signed a collaboration agreement. As an extra part of the business exploring we will conduct and market analysis for the Univariety platform (with our services) in China in which Tutee operates. Finally, we are going to Investigate IT outsourcing opportunities for Tutee in India, as we are looking for expanding our developing team with competent programmers.</narrative>
  </description>
